<title>USA: Plenum Publishing Corp Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Plenum Publishing Corp Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net			  1,360		    2,480</p>
<p> Revs			12,287		   12,848</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,872		    3,942</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the first quarter of 1997 includes net realized gains on the sale of marketable securities of $202,381 and net unrealized loss on marketable securities of $2,524,800.</p>
<p>Net income for the first quarter of 1996 includes net realized gains on the sale of marketable securities of $438,318, net unrealized loss on marketable securities of $1,365,145 and income of $70,472 from J.S. canner &amp; Co Inc which was discontinued operations, net of income tax of $45,000.</p>
